{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e568b9abe47cecf0f936c3053f0ff536ffb2858d2f55e59eb5a694d382215752","ja":"ツアーPRは前途多難？","zh":"巡演宣传困难重重？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9d36a74ce837b2d49e512aaa6dc9842f0c7a203e5bc18fa8b9a1eb85444f42a6","ja":"雪歩たち4人は、列車旅ツアーの\nPRキャンペーンガールを務めることになって……","zh":"雪步等4人将担任列车旅行团的\n宣传活动女郎……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b7291f5dfd2e03be1e80b36512403ebe375285bb4d8508302c3cb8b2290692b5","ja":"極上の秘湯をめぐる、お得なツアーパックです。\nご家族やご友人と、ぜひ。","zh":"这是一项巡游绝妙秘汤的超值旅游套餐。\n欢迎与家人或朋友一同前来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a9cf22a121fb17da63991df49c4a7c45fb9a49a3b4b9ca8997d23bcb3701a039","ja":"「へえ、あなたたちが宣伝してるの。\n頑張ってるわねえ」","zh":"“哎，是你们在做宣传啊。\n真努力呢”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ec5e3f77d103dbc9f3e73205500db624d2a0807c1a4d26cb820ee384fe11cfd9","ja":"ありがとうございます～！\n他にもありますんで、よかったらチラシどうぞ！","zh":"非常感谢～！\n还有其他款式呢，方便的话请收下传单吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"097042908b59e9ee1608ada873c4ef7185fa1165fe61586f54fac1bb64369f3a","ja":"「そうねえ……申し込むかはわからないけど、\nせっかくだし、もらうだけもらっておくわ」","zh":"“也是呢……虽然不知道会不会报名，\n但难得有机会，就先收下吧”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"313931a34dfa97039a1c341d55bf6b5f7d0b9b86127297324a801672997c6691","ja":"……そうですか。ありがとうございます。\nぜひ、検討してみてください。","zh":"……这样啊。谢谢您。\n还请务必考虑一下。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3d6151262af6f7b279fb2d6c803e49e398006dad3aaa2e1ad88efbb55fe9f2de","ja":"あ、あの……こ、こんにちは。よ、よかったら\nパンフレットを……あっ、行っちゃった……。","zh":"请、请问……你、你好。方、方便的话\n请拿一份宣传册……啊，走掉了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3a3a481b015209ab48030cde169ac1c9701eb4017b3c840e092b50c5c422a279","ja":"みんな忙しそうだよな～。\nチラシもパンフレットも、まだ結構残ってるぜ。","zh":"大家看起来都很忙啊～。\n传单和宣传册也都还剩挺多呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a333e6a873b13cdb2ef635b4a4f86645c12179d0ed2bb05466a8022b163c785f","ja":"人波はそれなりにあったけど、\nみんな、あんま興味なさそうやったなぁ。","zh":"人流倒是有一些，\n不过大家好像都不怎么感兴趣呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"1deb11946f61aa6e2e96145866ebaeea8f10bb5f4166a441e6758f3a1af0b84c","ja":"スタッフさんに聞いたんだけど、ツアーの\n申し込み件数も、想定より少ないんだって……。","zh":"听工作人员说，巡演的\n申请数量也比预想的要少……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"c870ac532a8b2784db0b6b765a0e25ed310ba045abdce9799b8aeb96ad2836ca","ja":"それでPRを強化するために、\n私たちがキャンペーンガールに選ばれたのですね。","zh":"所以为了加强宣传，\n我们才被选为宣传代言人的对吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"eb4e77a54156584984f03d05596f9e06fc1051e2710f89ec2f709ca1565ff53d","ja":"そっか……それなら、期待に応えたいよな。\n明日はもっと頑張らないと……。","zh":"这样啊……既然如此，可不能辜负大家的期待呢。\n明天得更加努力才行……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1597.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8a5b9d0ab64678496aaa49457aab8c68f86ab04566bffedfe7c9a1ec9f3335da","ja":"よーし！　ツアーを盛り上げる方法、\nみんなで考えようぜ！","zh":"好——！大家一起来想一想，\n要怎么把巡演的气氛搞热闹吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
